### CSAT survey API – manual request collection (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Prerequisite: system running (README / docs/deployment-guide.md), demo password = DEMO_PASSWORD in .env (default Demo@2026).
### Run the requests top to bottom: later requests reuse values captured from earlier responses.

@base = http://localhost:3000
@password = Demo@2026

### 1. Health check -> 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Log in as each role (tokens are captured by name)
# @name loginBgd
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"bgd","password":"{{password}}"}

###
# @name loginQuanLy
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"quanly.tt01","password":"{{password}}"}

###
# @name loginMarketing
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"marketing","password":"{{password}}"}

###
# @name loginHeThong
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"hethong","password":"{{password}}"}

###
@bgd = {{loginBgd.response.body.data.token}}
@ql = {{loginQuanLy.response.body.data.token}}
@mkt = {{loginMarketing.response.body.data.token}}
@sys = {{loginHeThong.response.body.data.token}}

### 2b. Wrong password -> 401 SAI_TAI_KHOAN_HOAC_MAT_KHAU
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"bgd","password":"sai-mat-khau"}

### 3. Current session -> 200
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ql}}

### 3b. No token -> 401 CHUA_DANG_NHAP
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

### 4. UC1 – system actor creates the survey of a CLOSED ticket without survey
### (with the seed data, ticket 8 is closed and has no survey; after the first run pick another one,
###  e.g. from: SELECT t.ticket_id FROM ticket t LEFT JOIN survey_response s USING(ticket_id) WHERE t.status='DA_DONG' AND s.response_id IS NULL)
@ticket = 8
# @name taoKhaoSat
POST {{base}}/api/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{sys}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket_id": {{ticket}}}

###
# the access code is the "t" parameter of survey_link, e.g. /khao-sat.html?ticket=8&t=9dad…851a – paste it here:
@t = PASTE_THE_32_HEX_CODE_FROM_survey_link

### 4b. Same ticket again -> 409 DA_KHAO_SAT (QT-10)
POST {{base}}/api/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{sys}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket_id": {{ticket}}}

### 4c. Wrong role -> 403 KHONG_DU_QUYEN
POST {{base}}/api/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{mkt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket_id": {{ticket}}}

### 5. UC2 – customer opens the link (no login, needs t) -> 200
GET {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}?t={{t}}

### 5b. A01 check (TC-10 by hand): ticket id only, no code -> 400 field t
POST {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":1,"comment":"đánh giá giả"}

### 5c. A01 check: guessed code -> 404 KHONG_TIM_THAY, survey unchanged
POST {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}?t=00000000000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":1,"comment":"đánh giá giả"}

### 6. Invalid score -> 400 field score
POST {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}?t={{t}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":6}

### 7. UC2 – customer submits -> 200 DA_TRA_LOI, low_score true
POST {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}?t={{t}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":2,"comment":"Sửa lâu, hẹn hai lần mới xong"}

### 7b. Second answer -> 409 DA_KHAO_SAT, first answer kept
POST {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}?t={{t}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":5}

### 8. Staff list – manager sees only centre 1, low scores
GET {{base}}/api/surveys?score_max=2&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{ql}}

### 8b. Manager asks for another centre -> 403 (QT-14)
GET {{base}}/api/surveys?center_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{ql}}

### 9. UC3/UC4 – CSAT report (board, whole company, default period = this year to today)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/csat
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}

### 9b. CSAT for one centre and one month (adds whole-company baseline)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/csat?center_id=1&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}

### 9c. Marketing with center_id -> 403 (BS-05)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/csat?center_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{mkt}}

### 9d. Impossible date -> 400 field from
GET {{base}}/api/reports/csat?from=2026-02-30
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}

### 10. UC5 – trend by quarter
GET {{base}}/api/reports/trend?granularity=quarter&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{ql}}

### 11. UC6 – low-score list
GET {{base}}/api/reports/low-score?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{ql}}

### 12. Centres for the filter
GET {{base}}/api/centers
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}

### 13. Soft delete the survey created above (QT-13) -> 200; repeat -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/api/surveys/{{ticket}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ql}}

### 14. Accounts – list managers
GET {{base}}/api/users?role=quan_ly
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}

### 15. Create a manager for centre 2 -> 201 (repeat -> 409 TEN_DANG_NHAP_DA_TON_TAI)
# @name taoTaiKhoan
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"quanly.tt02","password":"QuanLy2026","full_name":"Quản lý Tân Bình","role":"quan_ly","center_id":2}

###
@userId = {{taoTaiKhoan.response.body.data.user_id}}

### 15b. Manager without centre -> 400 field center_id
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"quanly.tt03","password":"QuanLy2026","full_name":"X","role":"quan_ly"}

### 15c. Malformed JSON -> 400 (not 500)
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"x", "password":

### 16. Read / update the new account
GET {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name":"Quản lý TTBH Tân Bình"}

### 17. Deactivate (soft delete) -> 200 is_active false
DELETE {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bgd}}
